### 第七阶段第二轮：内部知识文档与可引用问答
### 先在 scripts/backend/http/http-client.env.json 配置 baseUrl 和 adminToken/expertToken。

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8888

### 管理员登记经过审核的知识片段
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-UrbanSafe-Request-Id: knowledge-doc-001

{
  "documentCode": "INSPECTION-PHOTO-GUIDE",
  "title": "巡检图片拍摄与补拍指南",
  "documentType": "OPERATING_GUIDE",
  "documentVersion": "1.0.0",
  "securityLevel": "INTERNAL",
  "roleScope": ["ADMIN", "PROPERTY_INSPECTOR", "EXPERT"],
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "sourceUri": "minio://knowledge/inspection-photo-guide-v1.pdf",
  "contentChecksum": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "metadata": {
    "reviewed": true,
    "owner": "UrbanSafe"
  },
  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunkIndex": 0,
      "sectionTitle": "模糊图片补拍",
      "pageNumber": 3,
      "content": "巡检图片模糊时，应保持镜头稳定，补拍整体定位照、构件近景照和带比例尺的细节照。",
      "metadata": {"reviewed": true}
    }
  ]
}

### 专家提问；答案必须返回引用，证据不足时返回 REFUSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{expertToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-UrbanSafe-Request-Id: knowledge-question-001

{
  "question": "巡检图片模糊时应该如何补拍？",
  "topK": 5
}

### 未授权角色调用应返回 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{communityManagerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "如何补拍？"
}
